@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam Padding 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title 서버 객체 소유 관계와 공유 상태
hide empty members
class Server {
  - clients : vector<shared_ptr<ClientInfo>>
  + clientsMutex : mutex
  + AcceptClients()
}
class ClientHandler {
  - clientsMap : unordered_map<string, shared_ptr<ClientInfo>>
  + HandleClient(client)
  - ProcessMessages(client, line)
}
class ClientInfo {
  + socket : SOCKET
  + id : string
  + nickname : string
}
class RoomManager {
  - rooms : vector<Room>
  - roomsMutex : mutex
  + BroadcastToRoomExcept(socket, message)
}
class Room {
  + users : vector<string>
  + isInGame : bool
  + isCoopMode : bool
}
class UserManager {
  + CheckLogin(id, password)
  + SaveUserProfile(id)
  + SaveUserIcons(id)
}
class Player {
  + playerPositions : unordered_map<string, pair<float, float>>
  + playerPositionsMutex : mutex
}
Server *-- ClientHandler
Server *-- RoomManager
Server *-- UserManager
Server *-- Player
Server *-- MapManager
Server o-- "0..*" ClientInfo
ClientHandler --> RoomManager
ClientHandler --> UserManager
ClientHandler --> Player
RoomManager *-- "0..*" Room
note top of ClientHandler
연결마다 수신 스레드 하나를 생성하고 detach
서버 하나가 핸들러와 매니저를 공유
end note
class SocketOutput {
  - queue : deque<string>
  - active : bool
  - pendingBytes : size_t
  + Enqueue(bytes, length)
  + Stop()
  - Begin(operation)
  - Submit(operation)
  - Complete(bytes, success)
}
ClientInfo o-- "1" SocketOutput
ClientHandler ..> SocketOutput : QueueSend
RoomManager ..> SocketOutput : QueueSend
note bottom of SocketOutput
256 KiB / 4096 frames, including in-flight batch
1 shared IOCP output worker, partial completions
end note
class OutputDispatcher {
  - worker : thread
  - port : HANDLE
}
class OutputOperation {
  + owner : shared_ptr<SocketOutput>
  + bytes : string
  + offset : size_t
}
OutputDispatcher --> "0..*" OutputOperation : completion queue
OutputOperation --> SocketOutput : retains lifetime
SocketOutput ..> OutputDispatcher : post
@enduml
